{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> <strong>Join our Discord to start your first case!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you trust your wit, or your friends? </strong><br><br>In <i><strong>Red Chair</strong></i>, every character has their own past, their own desires, and a single goal:   <br>to become the city\u2019s greatest private detective. But to survive, you\u2019ll need more than just intelligence you\u2019ll need <strong>money</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each session, you\u2019ll face <strong>realistic</strong> case files generated by artificial <strong>intelligence</strong>. <strong>Together</strong> with your <strong>friends</strong>, you\u2019ll review <strong>statements</strong> and <strong>reports</strong>, analyze <strong>evidence</strong>, and fight to unmask the culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real <strong>danger</strong> doesn\u2019t come from outside it comes from <strong>within</strong>. Because one of your <strong>friends</strong> may accept a <strong>dark</strong> offer at an unexpected moment.<br>And in that instant, it\u2019s not justice that triumphs, but betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues may reveal the truth\u2026 <strong>but what about your friends?</strong><br><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/c38b380999a07766e5403a007b289426.poster.avif?t=1762424420\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/c38b380999a07766e5403a007b289426.webm?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/c38b380999a07766e5403a007b289426.mp4?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Equipment!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting each case, choose the equipment you\u2019ll take with you. Every tool has a cost, so manage your money wisely.<br>But beware\u2026 if you decide to be the traitor, the <strong>fake evidence awaits you on the Red Chair</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/01eb06dfb9115d4d2fd525fb5d3f8391.poster.avif?t=1762424420\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/01eb06dfb9115d4d2fd525fb5d3f8391.webm?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/01eb06dfb9115d4d2fd525fb5d3f8391.mp4?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Analyze the Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case file comes with evidence collected from the scene. Your task is to carefully examine it in search of the truth.<br>But remember: results may not always be accurate, as your teammates could sabotage them.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.poster.avif?t=1762424420\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.webm?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.mp4?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Careful!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you choose to be the traitor and it\u2019s great fun\u00a0 you must be careful. Even the slightest suspicion could lead your friends to vote and bind you. <br>You won\u2019t be able to leave the Red Chair. With tape over your mouth, you can only whisper to persuade them\u2026 and that\u2019s no easy task.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000360?t=1762424420","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/f28c76edb9487513148d751959f688f9daed0abf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762424420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/0217bea9d64a9e47ba714dde0cb32105d050d5f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762424420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/0217bea9d64a9e47ba714dde0cb32105d050d5f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762424420","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"During gameplay, cases may involve crimes related to violence, sexuality, or the use of prohibited substances, depending on the scenario. Participation in such cases is entirely at the player\u2019s discretion."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> <strong>Join our Discord to start your first case!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you trust your wit, or your friends? </strong><br><br>In <i><strong>Red Chair</strong></i>, every character has their own past, their own desires, and a single goal:   <br>to become the city\u2019s greatest private detective. But to survive, you\u2019ll need more than just intelligence you\u2019ll need <strong>money</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each session, you\u2019ll face <strong>realistic</strong> case files generated by artificial <strong>intelligence</strong>. <strong>Together</s