24420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/01eb06dfb9115d4d2fd525fb5d3f8391.mp4?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Analyze the Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case file comes with evidence collected from the scene. Your task is to carefully examine it in search of the truth.<br>But remember: results may not always be accurate, as your teammates could sabotage them.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.poster.avif?t=1762424420\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.webm?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.mp4?t=1762424420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Careful!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you choose to be the traitor and it\u2019s great fun\u00a0 you must be careful. Even the slightest suspicion could lead your friends to vote and bind you. <br>You won\u2019t be able to leave the Red Chair. With tape over your mouth, you can only whisper to persuade them\u2026 and that\u2019s no easy task.</p>","developers":["Tink Team Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/15c786800f4f8ae6256f093b2b1714ff78bf5648/header.jpg?t=1762424420","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Tink Team Ltd. 